# Answer 13 · The Status of Gender Studies in Pakistan and Views on Autonomy versus Integration (CSS 2023)
@py question 2023-2

## The answer map
::: fig mindmap | The answer map: every branch is one numbered heading of the model answer below.
@note A near repeat of 2016 Q2 — so organise the status as strengths, weaknesses, opportunities and threats, then argue a concrete dual strategy.
@ask ① WRITE A NOTE on the status of Gender Studies in Pakistan
@ask ② GIVE YOUR VIEWS on the autonomy vs integration debate
